WEBVTT

00:16:27.761 --> 00:16:30.803
PM: And we all need to do a lot more leaning in.

00:16:30.803 --> 00:16:32.004
SS: A lot more leaning in.

00:16:32.004 --> 00:16:33.234
PM: Thank you, Sheryl.

00:16:33.234 --> 00:16:34.468
Thanks for leaning in and saying yes.

00:16:34.468 --> 00:16:36.630
SS: Thank you.

00:16:36.630 --> 00:16:38.899
(Applause)